n></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为普通条件采样；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是纯无条件；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 则把图往&quot;更符合提示&quot;的方向推。从<a href=\"../foundations/score-based-sde\">基于分数的生成与 SDE</a> 的分数视角看，这等价于从一个被锐化的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>w</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x|c) \\propto p(x)\\,p(c|x)^w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 采样——指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 放大了条件似然的影响，这也是它和分类器引导数学同源的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    XT[带噪 x_t] --&gt; COND[条件前向 epsilon c]&#10;    XT --&gt; UNCOND[无条件前向 epsilon 空]&#10;    COND --&gt; DIFF[方向 = epsilon_c - epsilon_空]&#10;    UNCOND --&gt; DIFF&#10;    DIFF --&gt; SCALE[乘引导权重 w]&#10;    UNCOND --&gt; ADD[相加]&#10;    SCALE --&gt; ADD&#10;    ADD --&gt; RESULT[增强噪声估计]&#10;    RESULT --&gt; NEXT[送入采样器更新]&#10;    NOTE[每步需两次网络前向&lt;br/&gt;算力翻倍] --&gt; COND\">flowchart TD\n    XT[带噪 x_t] --&gt; COND[条件前向 epsilon c]\n    XT --&gt; UNCOND[无条件前向 epsilon 空]\n    COND --&gt; DIFF[方向 = epsilon_c - epsilon_空]\n    UNCOND --&gt; DIFF\n    DIFF --&gt; SCALE[乘引导权重 w]\n    UNCOND --&gt; ADD[相加]\n    SCALE --&gt; ADD\n    ADD --&gt; RESULT[增强噪声估计]\n    RESULT --&gt; NEXT[送入采样器更新]\n    NOTE[每步需两次网络前向&lt;br/&gt;算力翻倍] --&gt; COND</pre><h2 id=\"引导尺度-质量与多样性的旋钮\">引导尺度：质量与多样性的旋钮</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是文生图里调得最频繁的超参，它在三件事之间权衡：提示遵循度、图像多样性、伪影程度。下表是常见区间的经验行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>提示遵循</th>\n<th>多样性</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>跑题</td>\n<td>极少用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3–5</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>偏写实、保留多样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7–8</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>SD 系列默认区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–15</td>\n<td>很强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>过饱和、增对比</td>\n<td>强贴提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;20</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>很低</td>\n<td>色彩崩坏、伪影</td>\n<td>一般避免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的代价是分布被过度锐化：颜色趋于浓艳失真、对比过强、细节出现伪影，多样性也随之坍缩（同提示生成的图越来越像）。所以&quot;越大越好&quot;是误区，多数模型的甜点在 7 上下。不同主干甜点不同——整流流模型（SD3、FLUX，见<a href=\"../applications/text-to-image\">文生图系统</a>）通常用更低的引导尺度就够，因为它们的条件遵循本就更强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价-纠缠与必须协同的调参\">代价、纠缠与必须协同的调参</h2><p>CFG 不是免费的：它每一步要跑两次网络前向（条件 + 无条件），把推理算力直接翻倍。这在多步采样里还能忍，但和<a href=\"distillation-fewstep\">蒸馏与少步采样</a> 一撞就尖锐了——少步模型本就为省算力而生，再翻倍很不划算。于是出现两类应对：一是把 CFG&quot;蒸进&quot;模型（引导蒸馏 / Guidance Distillation），让学生模型一次前向就内含引导效果；二是 SD-Turbo 这类一步模型干脆在低步设定下重新设计引导。</p>\n<p>CFG 还和采样器深度纠缠。大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 会放大去噪信号的尺度，让高阶求解器（<a href=\"samplers-schedulers\">采样器与调度</a> 里的 DPM-Solver 等）在大引导下数值不稳，这正是 DPM-Solver++ 等&quot;引导友好&quot;变体诞生的直接动因。一个常见的稳质量技巧是<strong>动态阈值（dynamic thresholding）</strong>：每步把预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按其分位数裁剪并重新缩放，抑制大引导导致的像素溢出，Imagen 用它在高引导下仍保持自然色彩。换句话说，引导尺度、采样器、阈值这三者必须当成一组联调，单调任何一个都可能翻车。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改进变体与前沿\">改进变体与前沿</h2><p>朴素 CFG 的两个痛点——算力翻倍、大尺度伪影——催生了一连串改进。<strong>引导区间限制</strong>发现并非每一步都需要引导：只在中段噪声水平施加引导、首尾几步关掉，既省算力又减伪影。<strong>CFG++ / 重缩放</strong>通过对外推项做归一化或重缩放，缓解过饱和，让高遵循与自然色彩兼得。<strong>自适应引导</strong>让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间步或内容动态变化，而非全程恒定。<strong>感知/负向引导</strong>则把&quot;负面提示&quot;（negative prompt）形式化为把无条件项换成&quot;不想要的条件&quot;，让用户能反向排除元素——这已是 Stable Diffusion WebUI 等工具的标配功能。这些 2024–2026 的变体共同的方向，是在不牺牲遵循度的前提下削掉 CFG 的副作用与开销。</p>\n<p>值得回到全局看一眼 CFG 的位置：它是注入机制（<a href=\"../architectures/conditioning-guidance\">条件控制与引导</a> 的交叉注意力）之上的放大器，是采样器之内每步都要算的一环，又是蒸馏要专门处理的负担。理解了这三层关系，就理解了为什么&quot;调 CFG&quot;几乎是每个文生图工程师的肌肉记忆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调参权衡与常见误区\">调参权衡与常见误区</h2><p>CFG 的旋钮只有一个，但它牵动三件事，取舍必须一起算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调整方向</th>\n<th>提示遵循</th>\n<th>多样性</th>\n<th>伪影风险</th>\n<th>推理成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>上升（过饱和、增对比）</td>\n<td>不变（恒为双前向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导区间限制</td>\n<td>基本保持</td>\n<td>略升</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>下降（部分步省一次前向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导蒸馏</td>\n<td>基本保持</td>\n<td>视学生而定</td>\n<td>取决于蒸馏质量</td>\n<td>下降（学生不再双前向）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常见误区有三：以为&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越贴合提示就越好&quot;（越过甜点后画质反而崩）；以为&quot;CFG 的算力开销可以忽略&quot;（每步双前向，在多步与视频场景下是实打实的翻倍）；以及以为&quot;负向提示是另一个独立功能&quot;（它本质是把无条件项换成&quot;不想要的条件&quot;，仍是同一套外推）。真正吃透 CFG 的人，调参时看的是&quot;遵循—多样性—伪影—成本&quot;这四者的平衡点，而不是单一指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CFG 让模型同时学条件与无条件去噪，采样时沿&quot;条件方向&quot;外推，等价于从被指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 锐化的分布采样。</li>\n<li>引导权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 在提示遵循、多样性、伪影间权衡；甜点多在 7 上下，过大导致过饱和与多样性坍缩。</li>\n<li>CFG 每步双前向使算力翻倍，与少步蒸馏冲突，催生引导蒸馏；它还与高阶采样器纠缠，需配 DPM-Solver++、动态阈值联调。</li>\n<li>改进变体（引导区间限制、CFG++/重缩放、自适应引导、负向引导）旨在保遵循的同时削副作用与开销。</li>\n<li>CFG 处于&quot;注入之上、采样之内、蒸馏之外&quot;的枢纽位置，是文生图工程的核心旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无分类器引导","id":"无分类器引导"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在采样时放大条件方向","id":"核心概念-在采样时放大条件方向"},{"level":2,"text":"引导尺度：质量与多样性的旋钮","id":"引导尺度-质量与多样性的旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"代价、纠缠与必须协同的调参","id":"代价-纠缠与必须协同的调参"},{"level":2,"text":"改进变体与前沿","id":"改进变体与前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"调参权衡与常见误区","id":"调参权衡与常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"蒸馏与少步采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/sampling/distillation-fewstep"},"next":{"title":"文生图系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/applications/text-to-image"}}